; WN4K check-in request capture for Quantumult X build 934 or newer.
; Sign in and manually check in once per account to learn the real request.
; Import either this resource or wn4k.qx.snippet, not both.
hostname = wn4k.com, www.wn4k.com
^https:\/\/(?:www\.)?wn4k\.com(?::443)?\/(?:user(?:\/|[.?])|index\.php\/user(?:\/|[.?])|index\.php\?s=(?:\/|%2[Ff])user(?:\/|%2[Ff])) url script-request-body https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Viceroy-Dennis/quantumultx-scripts/a1a1caa926e578301510ab797fa945aead93e88e/scripts/wn4k.qx.checkin.js
